      },
      "lockedDecisions": [
        "Pin scenes get unique distances (V3 3.2vh, V4 2.8vh, V10 2.4vh, S12 3.4vh, Results 2.0vh) — asymmetry intentional",
        "3D limited to V3 rings + S12 self-improvement loop. All other sections stay 2D. Mixing is the principle.",
        "No bloom pass on Three.js scenes (dashboard v15 hotfix lesson — MRT alpha-clipping)",
        "3-light rig (cyan key #00D4FF + accent fill #47C01B + amber rim #FF8800) from yuri-os-dashboard reference",
        "Ambient text replaced with real data patterns — no keyword soup, no Rick-meme decoration",
        "Sankey is LINEAR (CLI → BrainDump → Router → fan-out → SSE), not parallel branches — matches actual ReflectionService.start() flow",
        "Memory tiers visualized as depth-gradient stack (HOT green → WARM lime → COLD cyan → PULSE orange) with progress bars",
        "Cover braille portal at clamp(1.6rem, 3.6vw, 3.2rem) — 350% larger than initial. Slow rotation 110s.",
        "Contextual braille only — V3/V4/V6/V8/S12. Each pattern semantically tied to section meaning.",
        "Truth fixes: tagline 'Built conscious. Not babysat.' (not 'while you were sleeping'). 63% measured KV cache hit ratio (not aspirational 98%)."
      ]
    }
